    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rpht](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rpht) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 21 2025 3km SE of Kaliganj. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 23.8942 longitude 90.5788. It impacted 11224382 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
